          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, log_loss, root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier, DecisionTreeRegressor\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(131)\n\n# Bagian A: Geometri Axis-Aligned (Efek Tangga Gergaji) pada Batas Diagonal x1 + x2 > 0\nn_tr, n_te = 800, 600\nX_tr = rng.uniform(-2.0, 2.0, size=(n_tr, 2))\ny_tr = ((X_tr[:, 0] + X_tr[:, 1] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.12, size=n_tr)) > 0.0).astype(int)\nX_te = rng.uniform(-2.0, 2.0, size=(n_te, 2))\ny_te = ((X_te[:, 0] + X_te[:, 1]) > 0.0).astype(int)\n\nprint(\"=== Efek Tangga Gergaji (Staircase Geometry) CART pada Batas Diagonal x1 + x2 > 0 ===\")\nprint(\"Kriteria | max_depth | Daun | Akurasi Uji | Log-Loss Uji\")\nprint(\"-\" * 58)\nfor crit in [\"gini\", \"log_loss\"]:\n    for depth in [1, 3, 6, 10]:\n        clf = DecisionTreeClassifier(criterion=crit, max_depth=depth, min_samples_leaf=5, random_state=42)\n        clf.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n        acc = float(accuracy_score(y_te, clf.predict(X_te)))\n        ll = float(log_loss(y_te, np.clip(clf.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1], 1e-6, 1.0 - 1e-6)))\n        print(f\"{crit:8s} | {depth:9d} | {clf.get_n_leaves():4d} | {acc:11.4f} | {ll:12.4f}\")\n\n# Bagian B: Regresi Tren Linier + Musiman -> Interpolasi vs Ekstrapolasi CART vs Ridge\nt_tr = np.linspace(0.0, 20.0, 200).reshape(-1, 1)\ny_reg_tr = 3.5 * t_tr[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(0.8 * t_tr[:, 0]) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=200)\nt_in = np.linspace(1.0, 19.0, 100).reshape(-1, 1)\ny_in = 3.5 * t_in[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(0.8 * t_in[:, 0])\nt_out = np.linspace(21.0, 30.0, 100).reshape(-1, 1)\ny_out = 3.5 * t_out[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(0.8 * t_out[:, 0])\n\ndt_mse = DecisionTreeRegressor(criterion=\"squared_error\", max_depth=6, random_state=42).fit(t_tr, y_reg_tr)\ndt_mae = DecisionTreeRegressor(criterion=\"absolute_error\", max_depth=6, random_state=42).fit(t_tr, y_reg_tr)\nridge = Ridge(alpha=1.0).fit(t_tr, y_reg_tr)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== Interpolasi [1..19] vs Ekstrapolasi [21..30] (RMSE) ===\")\nprint(\"Model                     | RMSE Interpolasi | RMSE Ekstrapolasi | Pred(t=30) [True=101.0]\")\nprint(\"-\" * 88)\nfor name, mdl in [(\"CART (squared_error)\", dt_mse), (\"CART (absolute_error)\", dt_mae), (\"Ridge Linear\", ridge)]:\n    r_in = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_in, mdl.predict(t_in)))\n    r_out = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_out, mdl.predict(t_out)))\n    p30 = float(mdl.predict([[30.0]])[0])\n    print(f\"{name:25s} | {r_in:16.3f} | {r_out:17.3f} | {p30:10.2f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Efek Tangga Gergaji (Staircase Geometry) CART pada Batas Diagonal x1 + x2 > 0 ===\nKriteria | max_depth | Daun | Akurasi Uji | Log-Loss Uji\n----------------------------------------------------------\ngini     |         1 |    2 |      0.7433 |       0.5640\ngini     |         3 |    8 |      0.9017 |       0.2900\ngini     |         6 |   21 |      0.9500 |       0.3297\ngini     |        10 |   21 |      0.9500 |       0.3297\nlog_loss |         1 |    2 |      0.7433 |       0.5640\nlog_loss |         3 |    7 |      0.9200 |       0.2285\nlog_loss |         6 |   20 |      0.9517 |       0.3032\nlog_loss |        10 |   20 |      0.9517 |       0.3032\n\n=== Interpolasi [1..19] vs Ekstrapolasi [21..30] (RMSE) ===\nModel                     | RMSE Interpolasi | RMSE Ekstrapolasi | Pred(t=30) [True=101.0]\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCART (squared_error)      |            0.763 |            22.885 |      67.99\nCART (absolute_error)     |            0.856 |            22.885 |      67.99\nRidge Linear              |            2.880 |             3.068 |     105.30",
