          "filename": "13_1_mdi_cardinality_bias_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.inspection import permutation_importance\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(133)\nn_tr, n_te = 1000, 500\n\ndef make_bias_dataset(n: int, gen: np.random.Generator) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    # 2 fitur SINYAL SEJATI ber-kardinalitas rendah\n    sig_bin = gen.integers(0, 2, size=n).astype(float)          # 2 level (kardinalitas = 2)\n    sig_ord = gen.integers(0, 5, size=n).astype(float)          # 5 level (kardinalitas = 5)\n    # 3 fitur DERAU MURNI (independen penuh terhadap target y!) dengan kardinalitas bertingkat\n    noise_bin = gen.integers(0, 2, size=n).astype(float)        # 2 level -> 1 kandidat split\n    noise_15 = gen.integers(0, 15, size=n).astype(float)        # 15 level -> 14 kandidat split\n    noise_cont = gen.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)                   # N unik -> N-1 kandidat split!\n    logits = -1.2 + 1.4 * sig_bin + 0.35 * sig_ord\n    p = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logits))\n    y = (gen.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n) < p).astype(int)\n    X = np.column_stack([sig_bin, sig_ord, noise_bin, noise_15, noise_cont])\n    return X, y\n\nfeat_names = [\"sig_bin (2 lvl)\", \"sig_ord (5 lvl)\", \"noise_bin (2 lvl)\", \"noise_15 (15 lvl)\", \"noise_cont (N unik)\"]\nX_tr, y_tr = make_bias_dataset(n_tr, rng)\nX_te, y_te = make_bias_dataset(n_te, rng)\n\n# Pohon CART tak dibatasi -> rentan dibajak fitur derau kardinalitas tinggi\nclf_deep = DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=None, min_samples_leaf=1, random_state=42).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nmdi_imp = clf_deep.feature_importances_\nperm_res = permutation_importance(clf_deep, X_te, y_te, n_repeats=15, random_state=42)\nperm_imp = perm_res.importances_mean\n\n# Hitung juga berapa kali fitur derau kontinu dipilih di seluruh split internal pohon\nused_feats = clf_deep.tree_.feature\ninternal_feats = used_feats[used_feats >= 0]\nsplit_counts = [int(np.sum(internal_feats == j)) for j in range(len(feat_names))]\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Bias Greedy Split & MDI Inflation pada Fitur Derau Kardinalitas Tinggi ===\")\nprint(\"Fitur                 | Jumlah Split | MDI (Bias Latih!) | Permutation Imp (Uji Jujur)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 86)\nfor name, cnt, mdi, pimp in zip(feat_names, split_counts, mdi_imp, perm_imp):\n    print(f\"{name:21s} | {cnt:12d} | {mdi:17.4f} | {pimp:+27.4f}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 86)\nprint(f\"Total proporsi MDI yang dibajak oleh 3 fitur DERAU MURNI : {mdi_imp[2:].sum()*100:.1f}%\")\nprint(f\"Total Permutation Importance 3 fitur DERAU MURNI (uji)   : {perm_imp[2:].sum():+.4f} (~0!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Bias Greedy Split & MDI Inflation pada Fitur Derau Kardinalitas Tinggi ===\nFitur                 | Jumlah Split | MDI (Bias Latih!) | Permutation Imp (Uji Jujur)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsig_bin (2 lvl)       |            1 |            0.1326 |                     +0.0481\nsig_ord (5 lvl)       |           29 |            0.1283 |                     +0.0339\nnoise_bin (2 lvl)     |           26 |            0.0480 |                     +0.0031\nnoise_15 (15 lvl)     |           88 |            0.2084 |                     -0.0087\nnoise_cont (N unik)   |          208 |            0.4827 |                     -0.0025\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTotal proporsi MDI yang dibajak oleh 3 fitur DERAU MURNI : 73.9%\nTotal Permutation Importance 3 fitur DERAU MURNI (uji)   : -0.0081 (~0!)",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Bias Greedy Split & MDI Inflation pada Fitur Derau Kardinalitas Tinggi ===\nFitur                 | Jumlah Split | MDI (Bias Latih!) | Permutation Imp (Uji Jujur)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsig_bin (2 lvl)       |            1 |            0.1326 |                     +0.0481\nsig_ord (5 lvl)       |           29 |            0.1283 |                     +0.0339\nnoise_bin (2 lvl)     |           26 |            0.0480 |                     +0.0031\nnoise_15 (15 lvl)     |           88 |            0.2084 |                     -0.0087\nnoise_cont (N unik)   |          208 |            0.4827 |                     -0.0025\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTotal proporsi MDI yang dibajak oleh 3 fitur DERAU MURNI : 73.9%\nTotal Permutation Importance 3 fitur DERAU MURNI (uji)   : -0.0081 (~0!)",
          "explanation": "Mengukur pembajakan split dan proporsi feature_importances_ (MDI) oleh fitur derau kontinu berkardinalitas N unik melawan permutation_importance pada hold-out set.",
