          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `weakest_link_alpha(n_total, node_n, node_imp, leaf_ns, leaf_imps)` dalam NumPy murni untuk menghitung $R(t) = \\frac{\\text{node\\_n}}{\\text{n\\_total}} \\cdot \\text{node\\_imp}$, total risiko subpohon $R(T_t) = \\sum_k \\frac{\\text{leaf\\_ns}[k]}{\\text{n\\_total}} \\cdot \\text{leaf\\_imps}[k]$, dan ambang *effective alpha* $\\alpha_{\\text{eff}}(t) = \\frac{R(t) - R(T_t)}{|T_t| - 1}$, lalu kembalikan tuple `(round(R_t, 5), round(R_Tt, 5), round(alpha_eff, 5))`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef weakest_link_alpha(n_total: int, node_n: int, node_imp: float, leaf_ns, leaf_imps) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    l_n = np.asarray(leaf_ns, dtype=float)\n    l_i = np.asarray(leaf_imps, dtype=float)\n    # TODO: hitung R(t), R(T_t), dan alpha_eff = (R(t) - R(T_t)) / (len(l_n) - 1)\n    pass\n\nprint(weakest_link_alpha(n_total=500, node_n=120, node_imp=0.42, leaf_ns=[45, 35, 40], leaf_imps=[0.12, 0.28, 0.18]))",
