          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef weakest_link_alpha(n_total: int, node_n: int, node_imp: float, leaf_ns, leaf_imps) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    l_n = np.asarray(leaf_ns, dtype=float)\n    l_i = np.asarray(leaf_imps, dtype=float)\n    R_t = (float(node_n) / float(n_total)) * float(node_imp)\n    R_Tt = float(np.sum((l_n / float(n_total)) * l_i))\n    alpha_eff = (R_t - R_Tt) / float(len(l_n) - 1)\n    return (round(R_t, 5), round(R_Tt, 5), round(alpha_eff, 5))\n```"
