          "code": "import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\nfrom sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1330)\n\n# Bagian A: MNAR Missing Values — Native Default Direction CART vs Median Imputation\nn_tr, n_te = 1000, 500\ndef make_mnar_data(n: int, gen: np.random.Generator) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    x0 = gen.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    x1 = gen.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    # MNAR: nilai hilang pada x0 terjadi kuat saat risiko laten tinggi (mis. enggan melaporkan utang)\n    latent = 1.1 * x0 - 0.8 * x1\n    miss_prob = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(2.2 * latent - 1.5)))\n    is_miss = gen.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n) < miss_prob\n    # Target risiko melonjak tajam baik karena latent tinggi maupun mekanisme MNAR itu sendiri\n    p_y = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(latent + 2.0 * is_miss - 0.6)))\n    y = (gen.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n) < p_y).astype(int)\n    x0_obs = np.where(is_miss, np.nan, x0)\n    return np.column_stack([x0_obs, x1]), y\n\nX_m_tr, y_m_tr = make_mnar_data(n_tr, rng)\nX_m_te, y_m_te = make_mnar_data(n_te, rng)\n\ndt_median = Pipeline([\n    (\"imp\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n    (\"dt\", DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=5, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(X_m_tr, y_m_tr)\n\ndt_median_ind = Pipeline([\n    (\"imp\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\", add_indicator=True)),\n    (\"dt\", DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=5, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(X_m_tr, y_m_tr)\n\ndt_native = DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=5, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42).fit(X_m_tr, y_m_tr)\n\nprint(\"=== Bagian A: MNAR Missing Values — Imputasi Median vs Native Default Direction (CART) ===\")\nfor lbl, mdl in [\n    (\"SimpleImputer(median) + CART      \", dt_median),\n    (\"Median + Missing Indicator + CART \", dt_median_ind),\n    (\"CART Native NaN (Default Dir)     \", dt_native),\n]:\n    auc = float(roc_auc_score(y_m_te, mdl.predict_proba(X_m_te)[:, 1]))\n    print(f\"  {lbl} | ROC-AUC Uji = {auc:.4f}\")\n\n# Bagian B: Kategorikal K=24 — Bahaya One-Hot Encoding (Pohon Sisir Dangkal) vs Native Fisher Grouping\nK = 24\nhigh_risk_cats = set(range(0, 10))  # 10 dari 24 kategori berisiko tinggi (butuh kedalaman 10 di OHE!)\ndef make_cat_df(n: int, gen: np.random.Generator) -> tuple[pd.DataFrame, np.ndarray]:\n    c_raw = gen.integers(0, K, size=n)\n    x_num = gen.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\n    is_hi = np.isin(c_raw, list(high_risk_cats)).astype(float)\n    p = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(-1.6 + 2.6 * is_hi + 0.9 * x_num)))\n    y = (gen.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n) < p).astype(int)\n    df = pd.DataFrame({\n        \"wilayah\": pd.Categorical([f\"W{c:02d}\" for c in c_raw], categories=[f\"W{c:02d}\" for c in range(K)]),\n        \"skor_num\": x_num,\n    })\n    return df, y\n\ndf_tr, y_c_tr = make_cat_df(1200, rng)\ndf_te, y_c_te = make_cat_df(600, rng)\n\nohe_pipe = Pipeline([\n    (\"prep\", ColumnTransformer([\n        (\"cat\", OneHotEncoder(sparse_output=False, handle_unknown=\"ignore\"), [\"wilayah\"]),\n        (\"num\", \"passthrough\", [\"skor_num\"]),\n    ])),\n    (\"dt\", DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=4, min_samples_leaf=15, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(df_tr, y_c_tr)\n\n# Satu pohon dangkal (max_iter=1) atau ensemble kecil dengan native Fisher categorical splitting!\nhgb_1tree = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n    max_iter=1, max_depth=4, min_samples_leaf=15, learning_rate=1.0,\n    categorical_features=\"from_dtype\", random_state=42\n).fit(df_tr, y_c_tr)\n\nhgb_full = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n    max_iter=40, max_depth=4, min_samples_leaf=15, learning_rate=0.1,\n    categorical_features=\"from_dtype\", random_state=42\n).fit(df_tr, y_c_tr)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== Bagian B: Kategorikal K=24 (10 Risiko Tinggi) pada Batas Kedalaman max_depth=4 ===\")\nfor lbl, mdl in [\n    (\"OHE (24 kolom) + CART (depth=4)           \", ohe_pipe),\n    (\"Native Fisher Split (HGB 1-Pohon, depth=4)\", hgb_1tree),\n    (\"Native Fisher Split (HGB 40-Pohon, d=4)   \", hgb_full),\n]:\n    auc = float(roc_auc_score(y_c_te, mdl.predict_proba(df_te)[:, 1]))\n    print(f\"  {lbl} | ROC-AUC Uji = {auc:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Bagian A: MNAR Missing Values — Imputasi Median vs Native Default Direction (CART) ===\n  SimpleImputer(median) + CART       | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8437\n  Median + Missing Indicator + CART  | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8434\n  CART Native NaN (Default Dir)      | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8366\n\n=== Bagian B: Kategorikal K=24 (10 Risiko Tinggi) pada Batas Kedalaman max_depth=4 ===\n  OHE (24 kolom) + CART (depth=4)            | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.6733\n  Native Fisher Split (HGB 1-Pohon, depth=4) | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8229\n  Native Fisher Split (HGB 40-Pohon, d=4)    | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8302",
          "actualOutput": "=== Bagian A: MNAR Missing Values — Imputasi Median vs Native Default Direction (CART) ===\n  SimpleImputer(median) + CART       | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8437\n  Median + Missing Indicator + CART  | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8434\n  CART Native NaN (Default Dir)      | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8366\n\n=== Bagian B: Kategorikal K=24 (10 Risiko Tinggi) pada Batas Kedalaman max_depth=4 ===\n  OHE (24 kolom) + CART (depth=4)            | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.6733\n  Native Fisher Split (HGB 1-Pohon, depth=4) | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8229\n  Native Fisher Split (HGB 40-Pohon, d=4)    | ROC-AUC Uji = 0.8302",
