          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1349)\n\n# CI/CD Automated Compliance Audit Suite (Model Risk Management / ECOA / OJK 2026)\n# Fitur: [0] dti (+1), [1] late_12m (+1), [2] credit_score (-1), [3] log_income (-1), [4] tenure_yr (0)\nn_tr = 1200\ndti = rng.uniform(0.10, 0.90, size=n_tr)\nlate = rng.poisson(0.8, size=n_tr).astype(float)\ncscore = rng.normal(680.0, 70.0, size=n_tr).clip(450.0, 840.0)\nlog_inc = rng.normal(10.6, 0.5, size=n_tr)\ntenure = rng.uniform(0.0, 15.0, size=n_tr)\n\nlogit = -1.0 + 2.8 * (dti - 0.45) + 0.5 * late - 0.01 * (cscore - 680.0) - 0.6 * (log_inc - 10.6) - 0.08 * tenure\nlogit = np.where(dti > 0.78, logit - 2.0, logit)  # Anomali ekor tipis\ny_tr = (rng.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n_tr) < (1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-logit)))).astype(int)\nX_tr = np.column_stack([dti, late, cscore, log_inc, tenure])\n\n# Sampel profil audit (150 pemohon representatif)\nX_audit = X_tr[:150].copy()\nmono_contract = [1, 1, -1, -1, 0]\ninter_contract = [[0, 1], [2, 3], [4]]  # Grup utang tidak boleh berinteraksi silang dengan grup skor/pendapatan!\nfeat_names = [\"dti_ratio\", \"late_12m\", \"credit_score\", \"log_income\", \"tenure_yr\"]\n\nmdl_bad = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(max_iter=70, max_depth=5, random_state=42).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nmdl_ok = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n    max_iter=70, max_depth=5, monotonic_cst=mono_contract, interaction_cst=inter_contract, random_state=42\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\ndef run_ci_compliance_audit(model, X_ref: np.ndarray, mono_spec: list[int], forbidden_pairs: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> dict:\n    mono_violations = {}\n    for j, direction in enumerate(mono_spec):\n        if direction == 0:\n            continue\n        grid = np.quantile(X_ref[:, j], np.linspace(0.02, 0.98, 15))\n        grid = np.unique(grid)\n        # Evaluasi matriks (n_rows, n_grid)\n        preds = np.zeros((len(X_ref), len(grid)))\n        for g_idx, g_val in enumerate(grid):\n            Xm = X_ref.copy()\n            Xm[:, j] = g_val\n            preds[:, g_idx] = model.predict_proba(Xm)[:, 1]\n        diffs = direction * np.diff(preds, axis=1)\n        bad_steps = int(np.sum(diffs < -1e-9))\n        max_mag = float(max(0.0, -np.min(diffs)))\n        mono_violations[feat_names[j]] = (bad_steps, max_mag)\n\n    # Uji Zero Cross-Group Interaction pada log-odds (decision_function):\n    # Delta^2 f(x_i, x_j) = f(hi, hi) - f(hi, lo) - f(lo, hi) + f(lo, lo) wajib == 0!\n    inter_max_err = {}\n    for (i, j) in forbidden_pairs:\n        lo_i, hi_i = float(np.quantile(X_ref[:, i], 0.2)), float(np.quantile(X_ref[:, i], 0.8))\n        lo_j, hi_j = float(np.quantile(X_ref[:, j], 0.2)), float(np.quantile(X_ref[:, j], 0.8))\n        def eval_df(vi: float, vj: float) -> np.ndarray:\n            Xm = X_ref.copy()\n            Xm[:, i], Xm[:, j] = vi, vj\n            return model.decision_function(Xm)\n        d2 = eval_df(hi_i, hi_j) - eval_df(hi_i, lo_j) - eval_df(lo_i, hi_j) + eval_df(lo_i, lo_j)\n        inter_max_err[f\"{feat_names[i]} x {feat_names[j]}\"] = float(np.max(np.abs(d2)))\n\n    total_m_viol = sum(v[0] for v in mono_violations.values())\n    max_inter_leak = max(inter_max_err.values())\n    gate = \"PASS\" if (total_m_viol == 0 and max_inter_leak < 1e-9) else \"FAIL (BLOCK DEPLOY)\"\n    return {\"mono\": mono_violations, \"inter\": inter_max_err, \"gate\": gate}\n\nforbidden = [(0, 2), (1, 3), (0, 4)]\nprint(\"=== CI/CD Automated Compliance Gate (Monotonicity Sweep + Cross-Group Interaction Test) ===\")\nfor title, mdl in [(\"Model A: Unconstrained HGBDT\", mdl_bad), (\"Model B: Constrained HGBDT (Production)\", mdl_ok)]:\n    rep = run_ci_compliance_audit(mdl, X_audit, mono_contract, forbidden)\n    print(f\"\\n[{rep['gate']}] {title}\")\n    for fname, (steps, mag) in rep[\"mono\"].items():\n        print(f\"  Monotonic Audit {fname:13s} | langkah_melanggar={steps:4d} | max_drop={mag:.5f}\")\n    for pname, err in rep[\"inter\"].items():\n        print(f\"  Interaction Audit {pname:24s} | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = {err:.2e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== CI/CD Automated Compliance Gate (Monotonicity Sweep + Cross-Group Interaction Test) ===\n\n[FAIL (BLOCK DEPLOY)] Model A: Unconstrained HGBDT\n  Monotonic Audit dti_ratio     | langkah_melanggar= 669 | max_drop=0.61311\n  Monotonic Audit late_12m      | langkah_melanggar=  48 | max_drop=0.26327\n  Monotonic Audit credit_score  | langkah_melanggar= 699 | max_drop=0.22339\n  Monotonic Audit log_income    | langkah_melanggar= 746 | max_drop=0.17857\n  Interaction Audit dti_ratio x credit_score | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 1.49e+00\n  Interaction Audit late_12m x log_income    | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 1.09e+00\n  Interaction Audit dti_ratio x tenure_yr    | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 1.80e+00\n\n[PASS] Model B: Constrained HGBDT (Production)\n  Monotonic Audit dti_ratio     | langkah_melanggar=   0 | max_drop=0.00000\n  Monotonic Audit late_12m      | langkah_melanggar=   0 | max_drop=0.00000\n  Monotonic Audit credit_score  | langkah_melanggar=   0 | max_drop=0.00000\n  Monotonic Audit log_income    | langkah_melanggar=   0 | max_drop=0.00000\n  Interaction Audit dti_ratio x credit_score | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 4.44e-15\n  Interaction Audit late_12m x log_income    | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 3.11e-15\n  Interaction Audit dti_ratio x tenure_yr    | max |Delta^2 log-odds| = 3.55e-15",
